description:
VARIATION OF CONDITION 2 (APPROVED DRAWINGS) AND CONDITION 8 (OCCUPANCY RESTRICTION) OF PLANNING PERMISSION REF:
25/P1575 FOR A LOFT EXTENSION, PARTIAL TWO STORY FRONT AND REAR EXTENSION OF THE EXISTING NURSERY. SOLAR PANELS AND AIR SOURCE HEAT PUMP ADDED TO THE ROOF. BIN STORAGE ADDED TO THE FRONT OF THE BUILDING. CYCLE STORAGE ADDED IN THE GARDEN.&nbsp;AMENDMENTS TO INCLUDE ALTERATIONS TO LAYOUT,&nbsp;
ELEVATIONS, WINDOW AND DOOR OPENINGS, ROOFLIGHTS, PHOTOVOLTAIC PANELS,
RESTRICTED-ACCESS BALCONY ARRANGEMENT, AND INCREASE MAXIMUM CAPACITY FROM 44 TO 63 CHILDREN.&nbsp;

